<section class="update" aria-labelledby="update-h">
<h2 id="update-h">Sasisho la programu</h2>
<p>Sasisho limepatikana kwenye diski ya USB: <code dir="ltr">@@BUNDLE@@</code></p>
<p>Sahihi yake imethibitishwa. Kulisakinisha kutazima na kuwasha upya kisanduku, na hakitapatikana kwa dakika chache.</p>
<p class="note">Sakinisha tu sasisho ulilokuwa ukilitarajia. Kisanduku kinakataa sasisho lolote ambalo halijatiwa sahihi na mchapishaji wake.</p>
<form method="post" action="/status">
<input type="hidden" name="lang" value="sw">
<input type="hidden" name="bundle" value="@@BUNDLE@@">
<button type="submit" name="action" value="install">Sakinisha</button>
</form>
</section>
